  <h3>Managing expectations for your group members</h3>
  <p>
    Dont assume your teammates are more capable then they actually are, assume
    they dont know anything.
  </p>
  <h3>Be very careful with file names</h3>
  <p>
    Git is sentistive with capitals of file names where tracking refs can become
    a problem. First time you even commit a new file make sure the name follows
    conventions. No special characters or e with line on top like that.
  </p>
